      "id": "node-fastapi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -440,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "#00FF66",
      "text": "### FastAPI Mesh Hub & Cockpit\n- `GET /api/v1/cockpit/status`\n- `POST /api/v1/cockpit/webhook`\n- `POST /edge/sync` | `POST /route`\n- `yby_machine` (YBY-Spec -> PWA)"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-inference",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -100,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "#8E8E93",
      "text": "### Inferência Local & Roteamento\n- LiteLLM Proxy + PrivacyGate\n- Ollama / `llama.cpp` (`qwen2.5-coder:3b`)\n- Embeddings locais (`all-minilm:22m` / offline)"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-data",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -440,
      "y": -20,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#8E8E93",
      "text": "### Memória, Cache e RAG\n- PostgreSQL 16 + `pgvector`\n- Redis 7 (cache + estado leve)\n- Fallback offline SQLite WAL / memória"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-mqtt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -100,
      "y": -20,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#00FF66",
      "text": "### Mosquitto MQTT Broker\n- Porta local `1883` (QoS 1)\n- `yby/cockpit/action`\n- `yby/audio/state` | `yby/nodes/+/telemetry`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-vault",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -440,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#F5F5F2",
      "text": "### Cofre Obsidian (`yby-vault`)\n- `00-inbox/YYYY-MM-DD.md` (captura tátil via PhoneBox)\n- `01-specs/` (`TEMPLATE_YBY_SPEC.md`) | `02-architecture/` | `03-hardware/` (`INVENTARIO_NOS_YBY.base`)\n- Indexador incremental Markdown (YAML + `[[wikilinks]]`) -> `pgvector`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-tailscale",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 320,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "#8E8E93",
      "text": "### Malha Privada\n- **Tailscale WireGuard**\n- LAN Local (`127.0.0.1` / subnet)\n- Zero dependência obrigatória de nuvem"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-edge30",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": -260,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "#00FF66",
      "text": "### Moto Edge 30 + PhoneBox\n- Painel tátil YBY ZERO (`#0D0D0D` / `#00FF66`)\n- Widgets GPU/VRAM/RAM, serviços e specs\n- Webhooks HTTP locais:\n  `capture_inbox`, `trigger_reindex`, `publish_mqtt`"
    },
